BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jules and Jim (1961)
DTSTART:20260924T023000Z
DTEND:20260924T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T023000Z
UID:DyvIK0gD7D
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesTwo Parisian lit
 erature-loving friends (Oscar Werner\, Henri Serre) are dumbstruck when th
 ey encounter Catherine (Jeanne Moreau)\, a real-life embodiment of passion
 ate\, adventurous living. Respect and affection flow freely between the th
 ree\, and soon a larking-about friendship branches into many configuration
 s of love.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/nouvelles-femmes/ju
 les-and-jim\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
