BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NAZA
DTSTART:20261012T230000Z
DTEND:20261013T003500Z
DTSTAMP:20261012T230000Z
UID:8c7mTp3oSn
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 80 mins (1h20m)\n\nDirected by Yuval Abraham and Rac
 hel Szor\, two of the co-directors of the 2024 Oscar-winning documentary N
 o Other Land\, NAZA reveals the systems behind Israel’s bombing of Gaza 
 and its mass killing of Palestinian civilians. Winner of Special Jury Priz
 e at the 2026 Venice Film Festival.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/naza\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ginger Snaps (2000)
DTSTART:20261013T013000Z
DTEND:20261013T033500Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T013000Z
UID:9WE2YUelBy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Ginger Snaps is
  a 2000 Canadian supernatural horror film about two death-obsessed sisters
 \, outcasts in their suburban neighborhood\, who must deal with the tragic
  consequences when one of them is bitten by a deadly werewolf. Intro by C
 inema Worker Larcyn Burnett.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/s
 iff-movie-club/ginger-snaps\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
